# Per-environment kustomize folders — real cluster values live on disk, untracked.
# Only kubernetes/template/ (the blanked template) is committed. New environments
# are copies of template/ (see kubernetes/template/README.md); add their folder
# name here so the real values are never committed.
kubernetes/panservice-servizi/
kubernetes/vetri_speciali_gcp/
kubernetes/skf-pume-dev/
kubernetes/testdialberto/

